ative:10-005-130-02:4","id":"10-005-130-02-4-p1","image":null,"method":"模型判讀","ocr_check":null,"page":1,"reason":"依文字層轉錄，對照渲染圖確認；4 條各占一行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","text":"一、關懷照顧弱勢家庭。\n二、積極爭取地方建設。\n三、努力推動地方產業。\n四、盡心盡力服務鄉親。","unresolved":0}],"specificity":[{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"funding","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-funding","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明經費從哪裡來","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"implementation","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-implementation","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有說明由哪個單位、以什麼程序執行","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"instrument","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-instrument","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文只寫出目標或方向，沒有寫出採用的措施","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"quantity","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-quantity","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有可以核對的數字","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"schedule","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-schedule","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出時間安排","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-001","criterion":"target","evidence":"彫刻休閒產業","id":"10-005-130-02-1-001-target","level":"partial","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文寫出「彫刻休閒產業」，符合部分明示：指出受益或受規範的群體、地域或機構類別","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.5},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-002","criterion":"conditions","evidence":null,"id":"10-005-130-02-1-002-conditions","level":"unstated","method":"模型判讀","reason":"原文沒有寫出適用條件、排除對象或替代方案","review_status":"未經獨立複評","value":0.0},{"claim":"10-005-130-02-1-002","criterion":"f